| File                            | Responsibility                                                                                               |
| ------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------ |
| **00-PROJECT-CONSTITUTION.md**  | Project laws, vision, non-negotiable principles, documentation governance                                    |
| **01-PRODUCT-VISION.md**        | Business vision, users, product strategy, marketplace rules                                                  |
| **02-ARCHITECTURE.md**          | System architecture (C4, backend, frontend, security, governance)                                            |
| **03-ENGINEERING-STANDARDS.md** | How engineers build software (coding, Git, testing, CI/CD, API, DevOps, observability, engineering workflow) |
| **04-FOLDER-STRUCTURE.md**      | Repository layout, naming conventions, package/module organization                                           |
| **05-DATABASE-DESIGN.md**       | ERD, schemas, conventions, migrations, indexing, performance, data lifecycle                                 |
| **06-UI-DESIGN-SYSTEM.md**      | Design tokens, components, UX patterns, accessibility, motion, theming                                       |
| **07-CURRENT-PROGRESS.md**      | Live implementation status and completion tracking                                                           |
| **08-DECISIONS.md**             | Project-level decision log (lightweight), linked to architecture ADRs                                        |
| **09-AI-COLLABORATION.md**      | AI workflow, prompting rules, AI contribution guidelines                                                     |
| **10-ROADMAP.md**               | Milestones, releases, backlog, product evolution                                                             |
| **11-CHANGELOG.md**             | Release history                                                                                              |
| **12-AI_MEMORY.md**             | Persistent project memory and context for AI collaboration                                                   |
| **13-GLOSSARY.md**              | Shared terminology                                                                                           |
| **14-CONTRIBUTING.md**          | Onboarding, development workflow, pull request process                                                       |
